  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.7.0-preview.1\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\n### New Features 🎉\n* Add ID-porten/Maskinporten ClientID to  by @martinothamar in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1326\n* Enrich  metric, add client ID during enrichment by @martinothamar in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1329\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* Footer in generated pdf should use dd.MM.yyyy HH:mm:ss by @HauklandJ in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1334\n### Other Changes\n* Minor telemetry improvements by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1331\n* Fix inconsistencies and improve test coverage on Expression and ExpressionValue by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1330\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.6.3...v8.6.4",
